  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pozole rojo gets its colour and heat from a fried "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chilli-paste"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "chilli paste"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " stirred into a long-cooked pork broth. Chickpeas stand in for the traditional hominy corn and absorb the broth beautifully. The soup calls for slow "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "simmering"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "simmering"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to pull the pork apart and meld the flavours into the broth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: set out the garnishes before serving. Cabbage, lime, and dried oregano at the table make this dish."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
